{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>魔術師甄澤權（Louis Yan）今晚（6月25）在紅磡紅館舉辦《“Once” 甄澤權穿越紅館魔術之旅2026》，門票全數售罄，觀眾坐滿全場，而且星光熠熠。甄澤</p><p>魔術師甄澤權（Louis Yan）今晚（6月25）在紅磡紅館舉辦《“Once” 甄澤權穿越紅館魔術之旅2026》，門票全數售罄，觀眾坐滿全場，而且星光熠熠。</p><figure><img alt=\"張智霖。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920560568307712731492.jpeg/cJaF5p3weA5nIMRiNSdhgDFaPnAzEyhoWg5zTGMOc0w\"/><figcaption>張智霖。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"星光熠熠。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920557678301184361495.jpeg/5dKtTHPVDiSU61QVaRGzhAPFstf2ICOyp3IPaJ5yD2g\"/><figcaption>星光熠熠。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳展鵬、單文柔一家人。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920554863792128274805.jpeg/_kSMNaQAvHY6a3ZcoelfMOV-mW_4vVDQ3MX1-uXF9fo\"/><figcaption>陳展鵬、單文柔一家人。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>甄澤權表演魔術張智霖陳展鵬捧場</p><p>入場欣賞的嘉賓包括有張智霖、胡杏兒夫婦、謝天華夫婦、陳展鵬單文柔、蔡一智夫婦、陳敏芝及先生、江若琳蕭潤邦夫婦、周勵淇、陳自瑤、陳庭欣、陳嘉寶夫婦一家、賴慧玲、林盛斌一家、楊潮凱、Coffee夫婦一家、蔣家旻、張秀文及先生、李思捷、Tim@Dear Jane、官恩娜、呂慧儀、麥玲玲、關楚耀、劉晨芝、黃健東、莊思敏及先生、林鈺洧、彭慧中、康子妮、周美鳯、Michael Jackson兒子Brandon等。</p><figure><img alt=\"樂易玲亦出席。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920574321692672237649.jpeg/adqYGmIHoHk8j9MroV9KhihldzJVtIRQ4vXeWtv13lo\"/><figcaption>樂易玲亦出席。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"官恩娜、呂慧儀。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920571662372864068147.jpeg/PVfmhU_sXeRh_e2u4V-_5ysnrSJYwbAZwhY-PvsWPj4\"/><figcaption>官恩娜、呂慧儀。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920568675897344856401.jpeg/G3KqJ5tABoWYyrN13rGstsvZ1R73IoM934y8NuaMvDY\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡一智夫婦（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146920565894942720905426.jpeg/bBIjXXHcd9eRgWHRqcYQ89F8IRtpVLFW1ngmve94Jr0\"/><figcaption>蔡一智夫婦（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多位藝人送花籃賀開騷。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922554628247552286457.jpeg/fMyxUSoWKlryxEr94bvUtKu8f5daLAA9rBpWLoUaVi4\"/><figcaption>多位藝人送花籃賀開騷。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多位藝人送花籃賀開騷。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922611230904320967305.jpeg/k2LSxAPpS5fL7SmNaiU239D_5HrSNLQoFMl_0z3Jf9M\"/><figcaption>多位藝人送花籃賀開騷。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多位藝人送花籃賀開騷。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922608445755392790653.jpeg/DKa9l5N1J9LLL4gPvRKxR7kSSfRo1mO9s1hjY5pYY2M\"/><figcaption>多位藝人送花籃賀開騷。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922605471862784825169.jpeg/6pdVbMh9CjuTWoDRjHWa5WLTAlTAyxlaT6K4MWaiuDE\"/><figcaption>勁！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922602439249920521780.jpeg/24njznJhXh3b9narPmRyl7Ox97ITr94sSe03AWDtNwE\"/><figcaption>勁！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"星光熠熠！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922599498911744594172.jpeg/A4XznRTo6Eh8NZwXgbGC0LWyF7WlNFoK6VvEBcBbxAU\"/><figcaption>星光熠熠！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"星光熠熠！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922610027139072128375.jpeg/s1RtusP4X-yMZylXqmlPoO3kNYQl4PSB6jJkOsMyZDo\"/><figcaption>星光熠熠！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922607355236352372651.jpeg/JtxUXWe3u5Dt7u_WBRYYCl50Fv8Vhc2pnbHRdrSx0XY\"/><figcaption>人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922604473618432643985.jpeg/s3MqdOCF2_1am71EWWc1erAHqi7ZhM8WhYe0s6yHtLM\"/><figcaption>人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922601512308736248759.jpeg/OKGgIj-mAM6tJhfKry9kZ5VKJ50jFEi5LSk6hQQpOoU\"/><figcaption>人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146922598391615488954381.jpeg/yzVfJMeiKX89QsdjYxMYxe9qpS4X8DTUTzZtrmY2ba4\"/><figcaption>人緣好！（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T13:19:42.090144+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":625,"images":18,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}